WEBVTT

00:01:31.020 --> 00:01:33.360
<i>The middle school division
of Shuchiin Academy</i>

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:35.610
<i>is five minutes away
from the high school division.</i>

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:37.280
<i>Because of short distance,</i>

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:41.120
<i>quite a few younger students visit
their elders in the high school division.</i>

00:01:41.870 --> 00:01:45.290
<i>In fact, that day, one girl...</i>

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.040
Yes?

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.420
Excuse me.

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:55.130
Oh, a cute visitor.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:57.590
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

00:01:57.590 --> 00:02:00.390
<i>It's probably rude to call someone cute
the first time you meet.</i>

00:02:00.930 --> 00:02:04.520
<i>But for some reason, I can't take
my eyes off of her. Why's that?</i>

00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:08.940
I'm Kei Shirogane, the treasurer
of the middle school student council.

00:02:09.520 --> 00:02:12.190
<i>Kei Shirogane... Kei Shirogane...</i>

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.440
KEI SHIROGANE

00:02:13.020 --> 00:02:14.440
<i>Shirogane...</i>

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:15.820
<i>This girl...</i>

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:18.400
<i>She's the president's little sister!</i>

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:22.410
<i>I see it! She has the same scary eyes!</i>

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.200
Well, please come in.

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:27.040
Okay, thank you.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:34.550
KAGUYA WANTS HER TO SAY IT

00:02:30.290 --> 00:02:34.550
If you're looking for the president,
he's at a club budget meeting.

00:02:35.130 --> 00:02:37.420
I think he won't be back for a while.

00:02:37.420 --> 00:02:40.050
A club budget meeting?
I heard a long time ago...

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.800
that a student council president
who transferred to the school

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:45.680
PRESIDENT OF THE ASTRONOMY CLUB
CAPTAIN OF THE JUDO CLUB
PRESIDENT OF THE OCCULT RESEARCH CLUB
CAPTAIN OF THE KENDO CLUB
PRESIDENT OF THE VOLUNTEER CLUB
PRESIDENT OF THE SAHA CLUB

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:45.390
made an insulting remark
during one meeting

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:48.560
and found it difficult
to live in Japan afterwards.

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:48.560
RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:02:50.560 --> 00:02:53.230
That rumor has been embellished
quite a bit.

00:02:53.900 --> 00:02:56.030
Then, it's not true?

00:02:56.030 --> 00:02:57.190
Of course not.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:02.530
The student's father was just relocated
to a remote country.

00:03:02.530 --> 00:03:04.200
He was deliberately sent away?

00:03:05.370 --> 00:03:07.580
I wonder if he's gotten used
to the thin air there.

00:03:08.410 --> 00:03:09.960
Will he be okay?

00:03:10.960 --> 00:03:13.170
<i>His little sister is worried about him.</i>

00:03:15.250 --> 00:03:16.550
It'll be fine.

00:03:16.800 --> 00:03:18.510
I swear by the name of Shinomiya

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:21.590
that if anything happens,
I'll protect the president.

00:03:21.840 --> 00:03:23.300
Shinomiya-senpai...

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:24.800
It'll be all right.

00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.640
Leave it to me.

00:03:27.180 --> 00:03:30.140
<i>To shoot the leader, shoot his horse first.</i>

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:30.810
ACQUAINTANCE
SIBLING
FRIEND
PARENTS
BENEFACTOR

00:03:30.140 --> 00:03:33.730
TARGET

00:03:30.560 --> 00:03:34.520
<i>To force a man to surrender, one should
first ensnare the people around him.</i>

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:31.310
ACQUAINTANCE
SIBLING
PARENTS
BENEFACTOR

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:31.850
ACQUAINTANCE
SIBLING
BENEFACTOR

00:03:31.850 --> 00:03:32.310
SIBLING
BENEFACTOR

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:32.810
SIBLING

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.280
<i>Making friends with his relatives
leads to a relationship with the family.</i>

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.530
<i>A situation encouraging
interactions with him...</i>

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:42.860
<i>Kaguya, you're like a big sister!</i>

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:46.160
<i>Yes! Yes, that's it!</i>

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.740
<i>I'll have this girl call me her big sister!</i>

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:49.160
HEH HEH

00:03:49.160 --> 00:04:01.170
GRIN GRIN

00:03:49.500 --> 00:03:52.790
So, what can I do for you today?

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:53.960
Um,

00:03:54.210 --> 00:03:59.050
I was going to ask my brother to check
these student council documents.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:01.170
In that case, I can give you a hand.

00:04:01.550 --> 00:04:04.300
Despite my looks, I'm pretty competent.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:06.600
<i>The competent woman appeal!</i>

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:09.060
Um, here they are.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:12.690
<i>Giving the impression of someone
who is capable to inspire feelings of respect.</i>

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:10.270
Let's see.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:16.440
The calculations are correct,
but you've got commas in the wrong places.

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:19.480
And the layout isn't very reader-friendly.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:20.320
He was here?

00:04:21.030 --> 00:04:22.070
I see.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:25.570
Then, I should stretch this out
to fill in the blank space?

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:29.790
And while you're at it,
I'd set up a macro for here and here.

00:04:29.790 --> 00:04:30.830
That makes sense.

00:04:30.830 --> 00:04:34.960
Group these. It would be clear
where you're supposed to look,

00:04:31.620 --> 00:04:35.750
<i>W-Well, it'd be difficult to get closer
to her as a competent woman.</i>

00:04:34.960 --> 00:04:36.500
so I wouldn't display any of this.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:38.460
<i>That would only increase
the sense of distance between us.</i>

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.460
I want all of this part looked at, so...

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:39.960
<i>We should be equals!</i>

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.510
<i>The goal should be a relationship
in which we hang out as friends!</i>

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.470
<i>And then...</i>

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:45.470
<i>Big Sister Kaguya!</i>

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:49.640
<i>You should come over
to my house for dinner!</i>

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:50.970
<i>Oh, would that be okay?</i>

00:04:52.520 --> 00:04:53.890
<i>You two are so close.</i>

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.850
<i>It's like you're real sisters.</i>

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:57.900
<i>We are real sisters, right?</i>

00:04:58.980 --> 00:05:02.990
<i>That's because you're
like my own daughter, Kaguya.</i>

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:05.780
<i>Why don't you move in here?</i>

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.160
<i>Wonderful!</i>

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.620
<i>Kaguya was starving for familial love.</i>

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.210
<i>Then...</i>

00:05:14.790 --> 00:05:16.370
<i>Say, Shirogane...</i>

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.790
<i>We're all Shirogane here.</i>

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.380
<i>You've got to use first names.</i>

00:05:24.050 --> 00:05:25.300
<i>Then,</i>

00:05:25.930 --> 00:05:27.340
<i>Miyuki.</i>

00:05:28.590 --> 00:05:31.850
<i>Kaguya.</i>

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:34.850
<i>Amazing! How far could this go?</i>

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.810
You should probably choose your range
and then use a table.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.730
<i>That's it! The feeling of friendship!</i>

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.360
<i>A strong friendship would be best!</i>

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.570
The formatted table form from Home...

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:45.610
Miss Shirogane,
would you like something to drink?

00:05:46.150 --> 00:05:46.990
Sure.

00:05:46.990 --> 00:05:48.320
Hello.

00:05:48.860 --> 00:05:49.870
Kei!

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.370
Hello, way of the sword!

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:54.620
Hello, way of the sword back!

00:05:56.710 --> 00:06:00.130
What's up?
Are you just here to hang out?

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:02.710
Yep, yep. I'm just here for work today.

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:04.300
Huh?

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:08.760
You two know each other?

00:06:08.760 --> 00:06:10.390
That's right!

00:06:10.640 --> 00:06:13.510
Kei and Moeha are the same year!

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.640
<i>I'm Moeha, the third daughter!</i>

00:06:16.100 --> 00:06:18.270
Sometimes Kei sleeps over at our house,

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.440
and even though we're three years apart,

00:06:20.690 --> 00:06:23.690
we're such good friends
that you wouldn't know it!

00:06:24.070 --> 00:06:25.150
- Right?
- Right?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:27.990
The other day, we played
a video game together, right?

00:06:27.990 --> 00:06:28.950
Right!

00:06:29.200 --> 00:06:31.530
Remember that dance you made up?
Wanna do it here?

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:33.870
I'm too embarrassed!

00:06:32.160 --> 00:06:36.120
<i>So, you've been carrying on like this
behind my back, huh?</i>

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:37.540
Let's do it! You did it for me
when we went to karaoke, right?

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:39.290
<i>Is that right? Understood. I get it.</i>

00:06:37.790 --> 00:06:39.290
Which karaoke place was that again?

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.920
I think I still have the video.

00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:43.920
<i>But Miss Fujiwara's position is that of a friend!
Nothing more and nothing less!</i>

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.920
Cut it out! Don't look for that!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.550
It won't take me long to pull it up!

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:45.550
<i>I'll take the status of "big sister"!</i>

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:46.800
Hey, Sis...

00:06:47.010 --> 00:06:47.920
<i>Sis?</i>

00:06:48.840 --> 00:06:51.930
Moeha and I are going shopping
for clothes in Harajuku soon.

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:53.800
Why don't you come with us, Sis?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.180
Sure, I'd love to go!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.680
<i>Sis?</i>

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:02.310
I love window shopping in Harajuku!

00:07:03.020 --> 00:07:08.320
<i>This is how Miss Fujiwara
steals everything I want.</i>

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:10.070
<i>Greed.</i>

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.450
Okay, as soon as summer vacation starts,

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:13.320
<i>It's people like this that ruin the planet.</i>

00:07:12.450 --> 00:07:15.910
we'll do the full course,
from morning until night!

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:17.080
<i>A cancer on Earth. How repulsive.</i>

00:07:15.910 --> 00:07:17.080
Yay!

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.540
Why don't you go with us, too,
Miss Kaguya?

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.000
Sure!

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.420
Jeez.

00:07:26.420 --> 00:07:29.800
<i>Miss Fujiwara is a good girl!
This is what I love about her!</i>

00:07:29.800 --> 00:07:31.630
<i>We'll always be friends!</i>

00:07:35.510 --> 00:07:37.180
How was your meeting today?

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:39.770
Well, I got through it.

00:07:40.640 --> 00:07:43.810
By the way, Kei, I heard
you stopped by our student council.

00:07:44.060 --> 00:07:44.900
How was it?

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:46.900
How was what?

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:51.070
Well, as your big brother,
I'm naturally curious about what you do.

00:07:51.070 --> 00:07:52.400
You're as nosy as a stalker.

00:07:54.320 --> 00:07:56.780
But Chika was the same as always.

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.410
Your treasurer was pretty gloomy,
but nice to me.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.920
And as for the vice president, Shinomiya,

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:10.170
I was so nervous around her
that I couldn't carry on a conversation.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.680
- What?
- Shut up! Drop dead!

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:20.430
RESULTS OF TODAY'S MATCH:

00:08:15.430 --> 00:08:17.100
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:20.430
KEI SHIROGANE LOSES

00:08:17.350 --> 00:08:20.430
<i>Kei Shirogane loses.</i>

00:08:20.430 --> 00:08:22.310
THIRD SISTER: MOEHA
SECOND SISTER: CHIKA
OLDEST SISTER: TOYOMI

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:26.650
Finals are coming soon.

00:08:24.480 --> 00:08:28.940
MIYUKI SHIROGANE CAN'T LOSE

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.940
Have you all been studying?

00:08:30.530 --> 00:08:32.700
Miss Fujiwara, that's not whistling.

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.950
- There's no need to study for exams.
- Oh?

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:40.240
They should be no problem
if you're studying right along.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.410
Last-minute cramming is absurd.

00:08:42.660 --> 00:08:44.370
You'll just wreck your health.

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:46.080
<i>He's lying.</i>

00:08:46.380 --> 00:08:49.460
I strongly advise you all
to avoid last-minute cramming, as well.

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:55.680
WHHH

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:52.760
<i>This young man has even taken
a leave of absence from his part-time job</i>

00:08:52.760 --> 00:08:55.680
<i>so he could stay up studying
in the ten nights before the test.</i>

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:57.850
<i>Final exams!</i>

00:08:57.850 --> 00:09:01.680
<i>At Shuchiin Academy, literature and science
exams are given five times a year.</i>

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.770
<i>Shirogane has achieved the highest score
three times in a row,</i>

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:08.690
<i>solidifying his position
as the school's academic leader.</i>

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:11.860
<i>Shirogane began at the academy
from high school.</i>

00:09:11.860 --> 00:09:13.940
<i>His grades are his biggest lifeline.</i>

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:15.700
<i>To maintain his number one status,</i>

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:18.700
<i>he wouldn't hesitate to strategize or even lie!</i>

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.450
Good point.

00:09:21.370 --> 00:09:24.080
Tests are a reflection
of your own abilities.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:26.500
Even if you push yourself hard
and get a decent score,

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:28.290
that doesn't predict the future.

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:29.460
<i>She is lying.</i>

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:32.460
The best thing to do
is take it in a relaxed manner.

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:33.710
<i>It's unusual for her,</i>

00:09:32.460 --> 00:09:36.470
RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:09:33.960 --> 00:09:36.470
<i>but this young lady is taking the finals
extremely seriously.</i>

00:09:37.050 --> 00:09:40.720
<i>Normally, being defeated
isn't necessarily humiliating to her.</i>

00:09:40.970 --> 00:09:45.230
<i>She knows that the occasional defeat
is part of the secret of success in life.</i>

00:09:45.680 --> 00:09:49.400
<i>But when it comes to studying,
that's a different story.</i>

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.730
<i>Shinomiya is a genius,
but pulling out all the stops,</i>

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.490
<i>she hasn't yet beaten Shirogane
in that field!</i>

00:09:54.490 --> 00:09:59.990
<i>Being a creature of pride, that kind
of defeat is an unforgivable disgrace to her!</i>

00:10:00.320 --> 00:10:01.370
Ishigami...

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:05.000
If you don't push yourself to the limit
this time, you'll be in trouble.

00:10:05.000 --> 00:10:06.370
If you fail again...

00:10:06.750 --> 00:10:08.500
It'll be fine.

00:10:08.500 --> 00:10:10.880
I'm studying hard for finals
this time around.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:13.880
Well, I'm going home to study.

00:10:13.880 --> 00:10:15.010
<i>He's lying.</i>

00:10:15.670 --> 00:10:19.260
<i>This young man only wants to continue
playing the video game he bought recently.</i>

00:10:19.680 --> 00:10:22.010
<i>He has the nerve to buy a game
right before exams.</i>

00:10:22.300 --> 00:10:25.770
<i>He lives fast and recklessly
as if he's sensed his own time of death.</i>

00:10:25.770 --> 00:10:28.230
<i>And getting failing grades
is the norm for him.</i>

00:10:28.230 --> 00:10:31.480
<i>This is the way of Yu Ishigami.</i>

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:37.530
I'm hopeless at Japanese,
and I know slang from other languages.

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:50.500
RUMBLE RUMBLE

00:10:37.530 --> 00:10:39.530
None of that's on the test,
so I don't do well.

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.160
The way you study foreign languages
is kind of unique,

00:10:43.410 --> 00:10:46.160
so, maybe studying the normal way
wouldn't be efficient for you.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.500
And the amount you study won't
necessarily translate into higher scores.

00:10:50.500 --> 00:11:04.260
ROAR

00:10:51.130 --> 00:10:54.380
Not studying at all
is indeed a viable choice.

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:55.750
<i>She's lying.</i>

00:10:56.010 --> 00:10:56.920
That's right.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:11:01.800
Instead of studying, in the days
before a test, I just sit cross-legged

00:11:01.800 --> 00:11:03.050
and focus on the subject.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.260
<i>He's lying!</i>

00:11:05.760 --> 00:11:06.930
I see.

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:08.640
Understood!

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:10.900
I won't study!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.150
HEH

00:11:11.690 --> 00:11:13.150
<i>She's serious.</i>

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:17.230
<i>This young woman has gotten tangled up
in Shirogane and Kaguya's sabotage.</i>

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:19.650
<i>As a result, her class rank
has steadily dropped.</i>

00:11:20.150 --> 00:11:21.700
AVERAGE

00:11:20.490 --> 00:11:24.280
<i>Although her grades are average,
she has a desire to learn.</i>

00:11:24.280 --> 00:11:27.330
<i>Despite her personality,
Fujiwara is a fine student.</i>

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:32.500
<i>She has no reason to be suspicious
of the words of Shuchiin's top two students.</i>

00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:37.170
<i>She doesn't realize
that they're playing dirty.</i>

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:41.340
<i>The exam is a battle that begins
before the pen is even picked up!</i>

00:11:40.670 --> 00:11:46.180
DUN DUN

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:42.680
<i>Not only relying on brains,</i>

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:47.180
<i>but using information, personal connections
and assets are all reasonable choices.</i>

00:11:47.600 --> 00:11:51.520
<i>A virtual war in which these talented students
use every bit of ingenuity they possess...</i>

00:11:51.520 --> 00:11:55.020
<i>That is what the final exams are!</i>

00:11:52.060 --> 00:11:55.440
FINAL EXAMS

00:11:56.690 --> 00:11:59.190
197TH OUT OF 199 STUDENTS
(FIRST-YEAR)

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:00.860
EXAM DAY

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.110
I'm nervous!

00:12:03.110 --> 00:12:07.450
If my grades drop again,
so will the amount of my allowance!

00:12:07.450 --> 00:12:10.620
Calm down. Panicking now
won't have any effect on your scores.

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:13.870
You're not nervous, President?

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:15.880
Of course not.

00:12:16.630 --> 00:12:19.340
I have faith in my own ability.

00:12:19.760 --> 00:12:22.260
I just have to regurgitate
what I've accumulated so far.

00:12:22.260 --> 00:12:24.010
<i>He's lying.</i>

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:28.060
<i>This young man is so nervous
that he feels like he may vomit.</i>

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.480
<i>He's quivering so badly
that he can't even hold his pen steady!</i>

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:33.350
<i>I will absolutely not lose.</i>

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:35.770
<i>No one but he could know...</i>

00:12:36.020 --> 00:12:40.780
1ST: MIYUKI SHIROGANE
2ND: KAGUYA SHINOMIYA

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.190
<i>that the pressure a king experiences</i>

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:40.780
<i>is infinitely greater
than that of challengers to his throne.</i>

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:45.410
<i>Only he knows the heavy burden
of the eternal quest for perfection.</i>

00:12:45.780 --> 00:12:48.660
<i>He knows what it's like
to compete with a genius.</i>

00:12:48.660 --> 00:12:51.540
<i>And he knows how much
he needs to sacrifice.</i>

00:12:51.950 --> 00:12:55.040
<i>Studying is his one and only weapon.</i>

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:59.590
<i>If he couldn't at least get better grades
than the girl who could do anything,</i>

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:03.550
<i>she would then be far away,
someone he could only look up at.</i>

00:13:04.970 --> 00:13:07.050
<i>He had to win...</i>

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:08.010
Begin!

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:10.640
<i>I just can't lose!</i>

00:13:11.140 --> 00:13:13.270
<i>...to be her equal!</i>

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.690
<i>I can't lose to Shinomiya!</i>

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.900
1ST: MIYUKI SHIROGANE
2ND: KAGUYA SHINOMIYA

00:13:21.530 --> 00:13:23.900
Nice job, Shinomiya.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:26.910
This could just be a matter of chance.

00:13:27.160 --> 00:13:28.410
Next time, who knows?

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:32.080
No, I'm aware of how hard
you worked, President.

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:34.160
Luck had nothing to do with it.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.000
I still have a ways to go.

00:13:37.330 --> 00:13:40.040
But I accept these results.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:41.170
<i>She's lying.</i>

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.840
<i>This young woman...</i>

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:45.970
<i>is so frustrated that it would be no surprise
if blood shot out of her eyes.</i>

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:47.890
<i>If this weren't a public place,</i>

00:13:47.890 --> 00:13:50.760
<i>she would stomp her feet
and roll around,</i>

00:13:48.260 --> 00:13:54.680
STOMP STOMP

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:54.680
ROLL ROLL

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:54.680
<i>but instead, she bit her lip
to keep the scream locked up inside.</i>

00:13:55.680 --> 00:13:58.440
You must be pleased, President.

00:13:59.150 --> 00:14:01.320
This makes four years in a row,
doesn't it?

00:14:02.440 --> 00:14:06.200
No, actually, there was
just too much pressure.

00:14:07.240 --> 00:14:10.910
To be honest, I only feel relief.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.330
I don't have it in me
to feel pleased anymore.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:17.080
Is that what it's like?

00:14:21.000 --> 00:14:22.460
<i>He's lying.</i>

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:25.340
Oh yeah!

00:14:24.380 --> 00:14:29.590
<i>This young man is so pleased that he's begun
shadowboxing for no reason.</i>

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.260
Did you see that, Shinomiya?

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:34.060
<i>And so, the final exams
of lies and deception come to an end.</i>

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.180
Okay, okay. It's okay.

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:41.940
RESULTS OF TODAY'S MATCH:

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.440
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:14:38.440 --> 00:14:41.940
SHIROGANE WINS

00:14:39.560 --> 00:14:41.520
<i>Shirogane wins.</i>

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:44.940
FIRST SEMESTER RESULTS
MIYUKI SHIROGANE 1ST —> 1ST
KAGUYA SHINOMIYA 2ND —> 2ND
NAGISA KASHIWAGI 4TH —> 7TH
CHIKA FUJIWARA 91ST —> 101ST
AI HAYASAKA 114TH —> 114TH
KASHIWAGI'S BOYFRIEND 139TH —> 84TH
YU ISHIGAMI 197TH —> 177TH

00:14:45.820 --> 00:14:49.030
<i>Let's back up a bit.</i>

00:14:47.990 --> 00:14:49.950
ONE WEEK BEFORE THE TEST

00:14:49.950 --> 00:14:53.080
FACULTY ROOM

00:14:50.450 --> 00:14:53.080
Ishigami, do you understand your situation?

00:14:53.700 --> 00:14:57.410
If you fail any major tests, you'll be
in danger of being held back next year.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.080
Yeah.

00:14:59.620 --> 00:15:01.670
You managed to get into high school.

00:15:01.670 --> 00:15:04.090
Are you willing
to let that chance go to waste?

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.590
Anyway, just be sure
you don't fail the finals coming up.

00:15:10.010 --> 00:15:11.050
Got it?

00:15:11.300 --> 00:15:12.090
Yeah.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.100
<i>Fail!</i>

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.980
<i>At Shuchiin Academy, a grade of less
than half the average is considered failing.</i>

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:20.600
<i>There are no remedial measures,
such as supplementary lessons.</i>

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:23.520
<i>Two test failures in a subject
results in a failing grade.</i>

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:26.110
<i>If a required course is failed,
the year is repeated.</i>

00:15:26.110 --> 00:15:28.940
<i>Ishigami has already received
three yellow cards.</i>

00:15:26.360 --> 00:15:28.940
No, really, I haven't even been sleeping.

00:15:28.940 --> 00:15:31.610
<i>If he fails another exam,
he'll be held back!</i>

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.610
This time around, I'm serious.

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.070
Well,

00:15:33.320 --> 00:15:38.410
as usual, you've got me thinking
that maybe I should buy a video game.

00:15:33.870 --> 00:15:39.870
<i>Even though he's in hot water,
it's as if he doesn't sense the danger.</i>

00:15:39.040 --> 00:15:39.870
It's been a while.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:45.290
YU ISHIGAMI
CLOSES HIS EYES

00:15:40.660 --> 00:15:44.130
<i>This is unbecoming of a member
of the student council.</i>

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:48.010
<i>If you do get held back, you won't be
the only one who's inconvenienced.</i>

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:49.880
...so I can play for five hours or so.

00:15:50.590 --> 00:15:51.720
Ishigami...

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:54.390
Could you come with me for a minute?

00:15:55.180 --> 00:15:56.430
What is it?

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.720
We can't talk here?

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:01.770
No. It has to be a place with no one else.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:04.480
Just you and me.

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:05.980
Forget it!

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.730
No way! I'm scared!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:08.780
No!

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:10.360
What's your problem?
Just come with me!

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:13.490
Are you gonna do
something terrible to me?

00:16:13.490 --> 00:16:15.240
SUPPLY ROOM

00:16:21.910 --> 00:16:23.830
This is because you tried to get away.

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:28.590
If you hadn't resisted, I wouldn't have been
forced to resort to such drastic measures.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.050
You're gonna do something terrible!

00:16:34.510 --> 00:16:37.890
Wh-What are you going to do?

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:42.980
You know what kind of situation
you're in, don't you?

00:16:45.060 --> 00:16:46.770
Therefore...

00:16:47.360 --> 00:16:50.860
CRITICAL SITUATION!!
LIFE-THREATENING!!

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:50.860
You're gonna torture and then kill me?

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:55.410
<i>Or, no, maybe she'll just do nasty things
to me until my mind snaps!</i>

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.370
For starters...

00:16:56.370 --> 00:16:58.910
<i>Just don't touch my video games!</i>

00:16:59.290 --> 00:17:02.040
I'm confiscating your phone
and blip-blopping device.

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:07.170
<i>I really did incur
her displeasure!</i>

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:10.670
<i>She's going to take her time
destroying my spirit.</i>

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:12.260
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:17:12.260 --> 00:17:17.050
<i>Please, anything but making me
eat small fish or forcing me to study!</i>

00:17:15.220 --> 00:17:17.050
Okay, next...

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:21.060
please eat all of these dried sardines

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.310
and then do all of these drills.

00:17:23.770 --> 00:17:25.100
Here, open wide.

00:17:25.640 --> 00:17:28.810
They're full of docosahexaenoic acid.

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:32.440
<i>Acid? She's gonna melt
my internal organs?</i>

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:35.450
HOURS LATER

00:17:42.370 --> 00:17:45.120
What kind of torture is this?

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.120
<i>This is awful.</i>

00:17:45.370 --> 00:17:48.880
<i>But on all of the important points,
I can catch glimpses of intelligence.</i>

00:17:45.830 --> 00:17:48.420
What did I do to deserve this?

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:51.710
It seems you have promise.

00:17:53.590 --> 00:17:55.970
We're going to study tomorrow
at the same time.

00:17:57.010 --> 00:18:00.850
In the name of Shinomiya, I swear
I won't let you fail the finals, Ishigami.

00:18:01.100 --> 00:18:02.220
Be grateful.

00:18:03.060 --> 00:18:06.020
<i>What's the point
of trying to make me smarter?</i>

00:18:06.020 --> 00:18:08.230
TO PREVENT HIM
FROM FAILING

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:13.980
<i>And so, the days
of intensive training continued.</i>

00:18:14.490 --> 00:18:16.610
<i>Ishigami made
several more escape attempts,</i>

00:18:16.610 --> 00:18:20.240
<i>but Kaguya caught him every time,</i>

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:23.240
<i>and eventually
he lost the willpower to resist her.</i>

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:28.120
LIBRARY

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:31.960
This reference book should make it easier.

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:34.170
Take your time
so you understand it thoroughly.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:38.050
Really, what's your game here?

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.640
What are you talking about?

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:42.100
I heard that if you fail another big test,

00:18:42.100 --> 00:18:44.350
there's a good chance
you'll have to repeat the year.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.390
I'm making sure
you're studying so that doesn't happen.

00:18:47.770 --> 00:18:48.770
That's all?

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.150
That's all.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.610
No way.

00:18:51.860 --> 00:18:54.900
Shinomiya-senpai, you're that caring?

00:18:54.900 --> 00:18:58.110
I don't usually do this kind of thing.

00:18:58.570 --> 00:19:01.660
If you want the truth, I'd rather
be focusing on my own studying.

00:19:01.660 --> 00:19:03.330
Then why...

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.160
That's Ishigami, isn't it?

00:19:06.290 --> 00:19:09.370
For real? Kaguya and Ishigami together?

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:10.670
Why?

00:19:10.670 --> 00:19:12.630
Why do you think?

00:19:12.630 --> 00:19:14.130
Gross!

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:16.880
That's enough.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:22.600
I don't really care if I get held back.

00:19:23.050 --> 00:19:27.060
Besides, I'm sure you've heard
about how I messed up in middle school,

00:19:27.310 --> 00:19:31.400
which is why you heard
everyone treats me like I'm a time bomb.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.110
I used to be a problem child
who refused to go to school.

00:19:34.110 --> 00:19:37.820
When other people see us studying together
and they start weird rumors,

00:19:37.820 --> 00:19:41.610
it'll be your name
that gets dragged through the mud.

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:46.620
True, all the noise in here
makes it hard to study.

00:19:47.580 --> 00:19:48.660
You girls...

00:19:49.330 --> 00:19:51.540
The library is supposed to be a quiet place.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:55.540
Or is there something
you want to say to me?

00:19:58.590 --> 00:20:03.550
Well, you shouldn't really
get mixed up with Ishigami.

00:20:03.800 --> 00:20:06.720
We're just worried about you, Kaguya.

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:09.520
Thank you for the warning.

00:20:09.930 --> 00:20:10.730
However,

00:20:11.140 --> 00:20:14.230
I don't judge someone
based on what other people say.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:19.740
I've already judged Ishigami
to be worthy of a relationship with me.

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:24.740
Do you have doubts about my judgment?

00:20:28.990 --> 00:20:34.080
I appreciate you standing up for me,
but people are gonna get the wrong idea.

00:20:34.880 --> 00:20:36.500
That doesn't matter.

00:20:36.710 --> 00:20:40.010
Right now, the most important thing
is making sure you don't fail.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:43.760
No matter who gets the wrong idea or what
they imagine, it's not going to sway me.

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:44.510
But...

00:20:44.930 --> 00:20:46.260
I told you.

00:20:46.510 --> 00:20:51.390
In the name of Shinomiya,
I vowed I won't let you fail the finals.

00:20:51.390 --> 00:20:53.020
So, I won't abandon you,
no matter what.

00:20:53.980 --> 00:20:57.110
Besides, without you,
the president would be troubled.

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:03.360
So, if you understand, start writing.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:05.360
Okay.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:09.620
It looks like...

00:21:10.660 --> 00:21:12.750
there's nothing I can do here.

00:21:13.620 --> 00:21:15.620
STUDENT COUNCIL ROOM

00:21:14.420 --> 00:21:15.620
<i>Days later...</i>

00:21:15.620 --> 00:21:18.630
We got through finals, everyone!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:23.590
Shinomiya-senpai, I managed not to fail.

00:21:23.840 --> 00:21:28.180
I guess I kind of had
the wrong idea about you.

00:21:28.680 --> 00:21:29.890
Ishigami...

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:36.150
CRUMPLE

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:35.020
What is this score?

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:39.440
You just barely passed.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.740
After all that time
I spent helping you study!

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.150
I studied pretty hard.

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:50.950
How dare you make me lose face like this?

00:21:50.950 --> 00:21:53.660
<i>Oh no! She's terrifying after all!</i>

00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:59.380
That's what Shinomiya is like.

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:03.210
She doesn't lie to herself.

00:22:03.800 --> 00:22:05.800
If she makes a vow, count on it.

00:22:06.090 --> 00:22:08.930
She has a nobility about her.
She'll keep her word, come what may.

00:22:09.680 --> 00:22:12.600
At first, I thought
she was cold-hearted, too.

00:22:12.850 --> 00:22:15.940
But when I realized the truth...

00:22:16.390 --> 00:22:18.190
When you realized the truth, what?

00:22:18.520 --> 00:22:20.440
Nothing. Forget it.

00:22:21.270 --> 00:22:22.690
It's an old story.

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:24.690
<i>Results of today's match...</i>

00:22:22.940 --> 00:22:26.950
RESULTS OF TODAY'S MATCH:

00:22:24.690 --> 00:22:26.950
SHIROGANE LOSES

00:22:25.110 --> 00:22:26.950
<i>Shirogane loses.</i>

00:22:27.950 --> 00:22:29.950
ISHIGAMI IN THE PAST
